sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as Cron Job (on EC2)
    participant Script as Backup Script
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant S3 as AWS S3
    participant Docker as Docker Daemon
    participant CW as AWS CloudWatch

    rect rgb(173, 216, 230)
        Note over Cron, CW: Automated Backups & Logging
        Cron->>Script: 1: Triggers nightly backup
        Script->>KC: 2: Executes realm export command
        KC-->>Script: Returns export file
        Script->>S3: 3: Uploads backup file
        Docker->>CW: 4: Continuously streams container logs
    end

    participant MigScript as Migration Script
    participant LegacyDB as Legacy MongoDB
    participant KC_Admin_API as Keycloak Admin API
    actor MigratedUser as Migrated User

    rect rgb(144, 238, 144)
        Note over MigScript, MigratedUser: User Migration
        MigScript->>LegacyDB: 5: Reads user data
        LegacyDB-->>MigScript: Returns user records
        loop For each user
            MigScript->>KC_Admin_API: 6: Creates user with temporary password
        end
        MigratedUser->>KC: 7: Logs in with old credentials
        KC-->>MigratedUser: 8: Forces password reset
        MigratedUser->>KC: 9: Sets new password and logs in
    end